  "description": "Rustic Rose Digital Paper Set is a beautiful collection of elegant background images, seamless floral patterns, and botanical textures, perfect for adding a charming touch to your next design project.\nThese seamless backgrounds would make classy backgrounds for your wedding invitations, scrapbooks, cards, business templates, or any other creative project!\n———♥———\nYOU WILL RECEIVE A ZIP FILE CONTAINING:\n• 16 digital paper image files\n• Images are in JPEG format\n• 300 DPI & 12 x 12 inches\n• These textures can be used for printing or digital scrapbooking, wedding invitations, websites, blogs, and many other great creative projects!",
